# Laravel Boost installs agent skills into `.agents/skills` (tracked, the cross-editor
# standard) and mirrors them per editor. The tracked Boost files are that copy, boost.json
# and the MCP entries in `.mcp.json` and `opencode.json`; the per-editor mirrors are
# generated, and `php artisan boost:install --skills` recreates them.
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
.cursor/
.junie/
